{"version":1,"reference":{"kind":"artifact_content","namespace":"#2989","artifact_type":"_dh-work-item-head-v1","name":"head"},"owner_reference":"#2989","content":"{\"version\":1,\"issue_reference\":\"#2989\",\"parent_revision\":\"1e7b712cd183ae6dda648db0eaa04e191da165cee4c50ae8a498894a659a8ff8\",\"root_revision\":\"1e7b712cd183ae6dda648db0eaa04e191da165cee4c50ae8a498894a659a8ff8\",\"body\":\"<!-- backlog-metadata:\\npriority: P0\\ntype: Bug\\nstatus: open\\nadded: 2026-08-18\\n-->\\n\\n## Description\\n\\nAn active branch ruleset exists on `main` (ruleset id 20773573, `enforcement: active`), but its required-status-checks list covers only 3 of the ~12 real CI jobs defined in `.github/workflows/code-quality.yml`:\\n\\n```\\ngh api repos/Jamie-BitFlight/claude_skills/rulesets/20773573 --jq '.rules[] | select(.type==\\\"required_status_checks\\\") | .parameters.required_status_checks[].context'\\n\u2192 JS/TS/JSON / Biome\\n\u2192 Python / Cross-backend tests (memory)\\n\u2192 Python / Cross-backend tests (sqlite)\\n```\\n\\nNot required: `Quality Gate` (the `alls-green` aggregator job at `code-quality.yml:307`, which already `needs:` all 11 real jobs), `Python / Tests`, `Python / Ruff`, `Python / ty`, `Local / Plugin validation`, `Files / Hygiene checks`, `Markdown / markdownlint`, `Python / Integration tests`.\\n\\nObserved impact: a PR can merge to `main` today with pytest, ruff, ty, or plugin validation all red, because none of those jobs (nor the aggregator that depends on them) gates the merge. This was not hypothetical \u2014 workflow run `32122651665` on `main` (commit `e4f4a8ba`) shows both `Python / Tests` and `Quality Gate` failed on a commit that was already merged.\\n\\nThis item was originally scoped more broadly (as \\\"no branch protection exists on main\\\") during initial investigation, but that framing was independently verified and refuted \u2014 a ruleset does exist; the actual defect is narrower and sharper: which checks it requires.\\n\\n## Acceptance Criteria\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\n- [ ] Work matches description\\n- [ ] Plan or implementation complete\\n</div>\\n\\n## Story\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\nAs a **developer relying on this plugin**, I want to **ci: required status checks on the main branch ruleset don't include the quality gate aggregator** so that **the tool works correctly and reliably**.\\n</div>\\n\\n## Context\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\n- **Source**: Workflow-quality review, 2026-08-18/19, adversarially reviewed and re-verified against live repo state 2026-08-19\\n- **Priority**: P0\\n- **Added**: 2026-08-18\\n- **Research questions**: None\\n</div>\\n\",\"digest\":\"5bdc20c8611892be08d2ed7f4bb4c3a83f6ec2bacd6d6cb4e8da2cf7e8d7753f\",\"comment_id\":\"IC_kwDOQGimCs8AAAABPgvx-w\"}"}